     "en": "A short story"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "In Chennai Ravi's street has a councillor for its ward.\n\"The Corporation looks after our city,\" said his mother."
    }
   },
   {
    "id": "explain",
    "type": "explanation",
    "provenance": "original",
